STRING 2039
{
These workers were not the only ones to go missing. Another group has yet to return from the ventilation corridors.
}

STRING 2040
{
I want you to follow their trail. Begin in the Trade Quarter, where they were last seen
}

STRING 2041
{
We call it the Undercity, carved from the sewers and catacombs beneath Lordaeron’s fallen capital.
}

STRING 2042
{
What is this place?
}

STRING 2043
{
And to answer your earlier question, my name is Anya. Now follow me. You have much to learn.
}

STRING 2056
{
What happened to me? Am I... dead?
}

STRING 2057
{
Undead. We Forsaken are former thralls of the Lich King, newly freed by Lady Sylvanas Windrunner.
}

STRING 2058
{
Whoever you were in life, you're now one of us.
}

STRING 2059
{
[fs]Guardia
}

STRING 2060
{
Try not to fall too quickly.
}

STRING 2063
{
[fs]Guardia
}

STRING 2064
{
Another recruit, Anya? This one better last longer.
}

STRING 2065
{
[fs]Guardia
}

STRING 2066
{
I’ve been itching for a fight!
}

STRING 2067
{
[fs]Guardia
}

STRING 2068
{
Finally, something other than a ghoul!
}

STRING 2069
{
[fs]Guardia
}

STRING 2070
{
Rise and shine, rookie!
}

STRING 2071
{
Once you’re done, come with me. There’s someone you should meet.
}

STRING 2082
{
More undead awaken amidst the ruins. Bring these new Forsaken to the safety of the Undercity.
}

STRING 2084
{
Sylvanas Ventolesto
}

STRING 2085
{
Seems lively down here. I suppose Sylvanas put everyone to work.
}

STRING 2086
{
We must all do our part if we’re to make this city truly ours.
}

STRING 2093
{
I take it you are not fond of Putress.
}

STRING 2094
{
His genius is undeniable. It’s his demeanor that leaves much to be desired.
}

STRING 2095
{
Still, he has earned the Dark Lady’s trust, and so I do my best to tolerate him.
}

STRING 2100
{
Sure. Mark the excavation site on our map and we’ll check it out.
}

STRING 2101
{
Anya, look! What is this--
}

STRING 2103
{
The Scourge!
}

STRING 2104
{
Scourge Fanatic
}

STRING 2105
// Units/Undead/Acolyte/AcolytePissed4.flac
{
Slaughter these traitorous Forsaken!
}

STRING 2106
{
It’s... it’s happening again...
}

STRING 2109
{
Garek, what are you talking about?
}

STRING 2121
{
Recruit the forces you require from the mercenary camp.
}

STRING 2122
{
Once you have what you need, strike hard and fast.
}

STRING 2123
{
All this fighting... in the sewers, in the city... I can almost remember...
}

STRING 2124
{
Garek. This is not the time to ponder your lost memories. Focus on the here and now.
}

STRING 2125
{
Can’t the Forsaken do the same?
}

STRING 2126
{
They’re raising the dead interred here to bolster their ranks.
}

STRING 2127
{
No. Only the Scourge possess the means to do that. We must rely on their control lapsing in order to recruit more to our side.
}

STRING 2128
{
Something is maintaining that barrier. Survive until it shows itself!
}

STRING 2129
{
We’re trapped! It’s an ambush!
}

STRING 2133
{
Then it would be a shame to let his shield go to rust. Use it to protect the Forsaken.
}

STRING 2135
{
The way is clear! Let’s move!
}

STRING 2136
{
This guardsman’s shield is pristine. He must have taken great pride in defending the city.
}

